, "en": "Flaming Lasso grabs both its target, as well as the target's nearest allied hero within %grab_radius_scepter% units. The secondary target is tethered to the first."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "drag_distance", "break_distance", "damage", "grab_radius_scepter", "tick_rate", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "chen_penitence", "name_zh": "陈·赎罪", "name_en": "Penitence", "description_zh": "对敌方单位造成伤害，并使其移动变慢，友军攻击他时攻速提升。", "description_en": "Damages enemy unit, forces it to move slower and lets allies attack it more quickly.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "speed", "bonus_movement_speed", "bonus_attack_speed", "damage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "chen_holy_persuasion", "name_zh": "陈·神圣劝化", "name_en": "Holy Persuasion", "description_zh": "陈控制住敌方小兵或者中立生物，并获得击杀金钱一定百分比的金钱。被劝化目标的最大生命值会被设为%health_min%。被劝化的单位将提升移动速度和伤害输出。陈自己的单位如果在%unsummon_time%秒内未受到伤害可以在全地图范围内成为技能的目标，施放后取消劝化。", "description_en": "Chen takes control of an enemy or neutral creep and receives a percentage of its bounty. Its maximum health is set to %health_min%. Converted creeps will have increased movement speed and bonus damage. Chen may globally target his own creep if it has not taken damage in the last %unsummon_time% seconds to unsummon it.", "notes_zh": ["如果达到劝化生物的数量上限后再劝化生物，最早劝化的单位将立即死亡。", "拥有阿哈利姆魔晶后可以对远古中立生物施放本技能。", "升级此技能后在升级前劝化的单位并不会增加生命值。", "劝化时单位的魔法恢复至满魔。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "神圣劝化可以对远古中立生物施放。根据上帝之手等级可以控制最多1/2/3个远古生物。使中立生物的部分技能额外升1级。", "en": "Allows Holy Persuasion to target Ancient creeps. Can control up to 1/2/3 Ancient creeps based on Hand of God's level. Additionally levels up some abilities of creeps by 1 level."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_units", "level_req", "health_min", "gold_pct", "movement_speed_bonus", "damage_bonus", "creep_ability_level", "unsummon_time", "unsummon_cooldown_reduction", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "spectre_spectral_dagger", "name_zh": "幽鬼·幽鬼之刃", "name_en": "Spectral Dagger", "description_zh": "幽鬼掷出一把匕首，留下一条暗影之径，对路径上的敌人造成伤害并减缓其移动速度。被匕首击中的单位移动时也会留下暗影之径。幽鬼在暗影之径上移速提升，并且可以无视地形移动。", "description_en": "Spectre flings a dagger to draw a Shadow Path, dealing damage and slowing the movement speed of any enemies along the trail. Units hit by the dagger also trail a Shadow Path. While treading the path, Spectre moves faster and phases through otherwise impassable terrain.", "notes_zh": ["在离开暗影之径后%dagger_grace_period%秒内碰撞体积依然为0，作为缓冲时间。", "不会触发法术抵抗或法术反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "bonus_movespeed", "dagger_path_duration", "hero_path_duration", "buff_persistence", "dagger_radius", "path_radius", "vision_radius", "speed", "dagger_grace_period", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "spectre_shadow_step", "name_zh": "幽鬼·如影随形", "name_en": "Shadow Step", "description_zh": "对目标制造一个无法控制的幻象，对其进行攻击。子技能空降可以将本体传送至幻象，并将其摧毁。", "description_en": "Sends an uncontrollable illusion at a target that follows and attacks the target.The Reality sub-ability may be used to teleport to the illusion, destroying it.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "illusion_damage_incoming", "tooltip_illusion_total_damage_incoming", "illusion_outgoing_damage", "move_speed", "bonus_move_speed_illusion_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "doom_bringer_devour", "name_zh": "末日使者·吞噬", "name_en": "Devour", "description_zh": "消化一个敌军或中立生物，获得其特殊技能。开启多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标）后，末日使者不会获得其技能。持续时间与冷却时间相同。", "description_en": "Consumes an enemy or neutral creep, acquiring any special abilities that it possessed. If alt-cast is activated, Doom will not acquire the creep's abilities. Duration is equal to the cooldown.", "notes_zh": ["末日使者将获得该生物的正常金钱，还有技能的额外金钱。", "如果吞噬的单位没有技能，之前获得的技能将会保留。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "吞噬拥有%AbilityCharges%点能量点数，能以远古生物为目标。获得的野怪技能拥有%bonus_aoe_pct%%%额外作用范围和%bonus_spell_amp_pct%%%额外技能增强。", "en": "Devour has %AbilityCharges% charges and can target Ancients. Stolen creep abilities have %bonus_aoe_pct%%% increased AoE and %bonus_spell_amp_pct%%% increased spell amplification."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bonus_gold", "creep_level", "hero_ability_steal_time", "can_target_ancient", "bonus_aoe_pct", "bonus_spell_amp_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "doom_bringer_infernal_blade", "name_zh": "末日使者·阎刃", "name_en": "Infernal Blade", "description_zh": "末日挥舞他的炽烈之剑，将敌人点燃。造成%ministun_duration%秒眩晕，并施加一个燃烧效果，持续%burn_duration%秒，每秒造成伤害，数值为基础伤害+目标最大生命值的一定百分比。", "description_en": "Doom swings his burning sword, igniting the enemy. Stuns for %ministun_duration% seconds and applies a %burn_duration% second burn that deals a base damage plus a percentage of the target's Max HP as damage per second.", "notes_zh": ["可以打断持续施法类技能。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["burn_damage", "burn_damage_pct", "burn_duration", "ministun_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "doom_bringer_doom", "name_zh": "末日使者·末日", "name_en": "Doom", "description_zh": "对敌人施加末日诅咒，对其进行驱散，并且使其无法施放技能或获得任何治疗效果，同时造成持续伤害。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Inflicts a curse that dispels an enemy and prevents them from casting spells or healing in any way, while taking damage over time.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "末日对敌人施加破坏效果。末日作用下目标%scepter_aura_radius%范围内友军也会受到末日的作用。可以对自身施放末日，使末日作用于末日使者周围的敌人。", "en": "Doom applies Break to enemies. Allies in a %scepter_aura_radius% radius around the doomed target also suffer the effects of Doom. Allows Doom to be self-cast to affect enemies around himself with Doom."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "damage", "deniable_pct", "does_break", "does_mute", "scepter_aura_radius", "applies_dispel_to_self", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ancient_apparition_cold_feet", "name_zh": "远古冰魄·寒霜之足", "name_en": "Cold Feet", "description_zh": "对一个敌人施加诅咒，造成持续伤害。如果目标没有在%AbilityDuration%秒内远离初始地点走出足够距离，那么将被眩晕并冻在原地。", "description_en": "Places a curse on an enemy, dealing damage over time.  If the enemy unit doesn't move outside of the given range from the initial location, it will be stunned and frozen in place after %AbilityDuration% seconds.", "notes_zh": ["每0.5秒造成一次伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_per_second", "break_distance", "stun_duration", "area_of_effect", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ancient_apparition_chilling_touch", "name_zh": "远古冰魄·极寒之触", "name_en": "Chilling Touch", "description_zh": "使自己的普通攻击附带距离提升，高额魔法伤害和减速效果。", "description_en": "Enhances Ancient Apparition's attack with increased range and a burst of magical damage and slow.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "移除了冷却时间。", "en": "Removes cooldown."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "duration", "slow", "slow_duration", "attack_range_bonus", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}]
